# sabotage=LoadsFoldedIntoTheirUsersOutlastWrites: the program answers something else
# FORM: AsRead
# REQUIRES: x86_64
# RUN: run-in-shell
# The element is read and stored to at one address in a loop. Held in a register from turn to turn it would not be loaded at all, and there would be no load to fold.
# OPTIONS: disable=b3:PromoteLoopMemory sabotage=LoadsFoldedIntoTheirUsersOutlastWrites
# CHECK-NOT: 1068 180
# PROGRAM-OF: loads-folded-into-their-users-outlast-writes-left-alone.ir
